@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_DO_LOGIN
@farmId = 1
@cropId = 1

### Cadastro: não permite escolher ADMIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Produtor de demonstração","email":"produtor@example.com","password":"Senha-apenas-de-demonstracao!"}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"produtor@example.com","password":"Senha-apenas-de-demonstracao!"}

### Fazendas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/farms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar fazenda: repita a mesma chave somente para repetir a mesma ação
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/farms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-farm-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Fazenda Esperança","ownerName":"Cooperativa","city":"Itu","state":"SP","totalArea":20}

### Talhão: substitua farmId pelo ID retornado acima
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/crop-areas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-crop-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Talhão A","cropType":"Milho","areaSize":4,"latitude":-23.26,"longitude":-47.30,"farmId":{{farmId}}}

### Observação SIMULADA: substitua cropId pelo ID retornado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/satellite-data
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-satellite-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"cropAreaId":{{cropId}},"source":"SIMULATED","ndviAverage":0.2,"ndviMin":0.1,"ndviMax":0.3,"surfaceTemperature":40,"cloudCoverage":10,"fireFocusNearby":true,"fireFocusDistanceKm":2,"captureDate":"2026-11-01"}

### Alertas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/climate-alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Banco e processo
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
